Subject: [test environment] crypto: pass negotiated features to vhost

The crypto backend left acked_features zero. In an IOMMU guest, QEMU
sent IOTLB messages while the backend had not negotiated IOMMU support.
Use the intersection of guest-negotiated and backend-supported features.
This companion patch targets QEMU 10.1.0, not DPDK.

--- a/backends/cryptodev-vhost.c
+++ b/backends/cryptodev-vhost.c
@@ -87,6 +87,8 @@
 
     crypto->dev.nvqs = 1;
     crypto->dev.vqs = crypto->vqs;
+
+    crypto->dev.acked_features = dev->guest_features & crypto->dev.features;
 
     r = vhost_dev_enable_notifiers(&crypto->dev, dev);
     if (r < 0) {
